{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485484,"name":"","username":"bit0rbit","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/bc79bd/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T14:46:37.134Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo matter which existing bot I talk to, they all say:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"lang-auto\"\u003eBot failed to respond\nSomething went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf I try creating a new bot, I get the same error message.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI tried updating the app and updating the grok computer but no luck.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis has been ongoing since about noon yesterday since I arrived to an area with spotty cell service. I figured it was just a connection issue but even after I got home last night \u0026amp; tried again they were all still broken.\u003cbr\u003e\nI tried again this morning both on my phone and my computer, still nothing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTry messaging any bot with any message\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTry creating a new bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAndroid\u003cbr\u003e\nWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 1.5.0 (120)\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: android\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.44.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: win32\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-additional-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-additional-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI also sent feedback via the grok bot app\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485484-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485484-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T14:07:12.895Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":37,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":186.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170912,"topic_slug":"all-grok-bots-fail-to-respond","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":134642,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/all-grok-bots-fail-to-respond/170912/1","reactio